BT 1 0 0 1 0 34.8 Tm /F1 10.2 Tf 15 TL .952719 Tw (The Smart Dustbin is a mobile waste-management prototype developed to improve hygiene, safety, and) Tj T* 0 Tw 6.793483 Tw (convenience. It combines touch-free lid operation, Bluetooth-controlled movement, two waste) Tj T* 0 Tw (compartments, gas/smoke alerting, and a mopping mechanism in one system.) Tj T* ET
