BT 1 0 0 1 0 49.8 Tm /F1 10.2 Tf 15 TL .318568 Tw (The prototype uses separate control sections for mobility and automatic lid operation. The mobility section) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.10605 Tw (uses an Arduino with an HC-05 Bluetooth module and four geared motors. The lid section uses an Arduino,) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.00005 Tw (an HC-SR04 ultrasonic sensor, and a servo motor. The MQ-2 gas/smoke alert is implemented as an) Tj T* 0 Tw (independent circuit with a buzzer, switch, and battery supply.) Tj T* ET
