BT 1 0 0 1 0 49.8 Tm /F1 10.2 Tf 15 TL 2.347765 Tw (Growing waste generation and hygiene concerns motivate the use of simple automation in everyday) Tj T* 0 Tw .921013 Tw (waste-management systems. Conventional bins are usually stationary and often require physical contact) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.931412 Tw (for opening and relocation. The Smart Dustbin prototype demonstrates how sensors, motors, wireless) Tj T* 0 Tw (control, and safety alerting can be combined to make disposal more convenient and hygienic.) Tj T* ET
