BT 1 0 0 1 0 49.8 Tm /F1 10.2 Tf 15 TL .93925 Tw (The project focuses on a practical prototype for household or small public-space use. Its scope includes) Tj T* 0 Tw .350741 Tw (automatic lid opening, mobile control, physical separation of biodegradable and non-biodegradable waste,) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.61721 Tw (gas/smoke alerting, and a mopping feature. The project is a prototype and is intended to demonstrate) Tj T* 0 Tw (integration of these functions rather than industrial-scale waste processing.) Tj T* ET
